th Damage and increases Death Damage done  by 8% per level"] = "Transforms Mutilar damage into Death Damage and increases Death Damage done  by 8% per level", ["Triggering glacial palm will now heal you by 15% (per level) of the damage done ."] = "Activar Glacial Palm ahora te curara un 15% (por nivel) del dano infligido.", ["Unlocks the spell Misiles Arcanos\\nEnergy Blast grants 1 charge of Arcane Surge for 15 seconds, stacking up to 6 charges. Each Arcane Surge charge increases the number of Misiles Arcanos fired."] = "Desbloquea el hechizo Misiles Arcanos.\\nEnergy Blast otorga 1 carga de Arcane Surge por 15 segundos, acumulando hasta 6 cargas. Cada carga aumenta el numero de Misiles Arcanos disparados.", ["Unlocks the spell Ola de Escarcha"] = "Desbloquea el hechizo Ola de Escarcha", ["Unlocks the spell Mano de Dios"] = "Desbloquea el hechizo Mano de Dios", ["Unlocks the spell Nucleo del Infierno"] = "Desbloquea el hechizo Nucleo del Infierno", ["Unlocks the spell Ice Clones"] = "Unlocks the spell Clones de Hielo", ["Unyielding Strength"] = "Unyielding Strength", ["Utility"] = "Utilidad", ["Veil of Echos"] = "Veil of Echos", ["VeilOfEchos"] = "VeilOfEchos", ["Veiled Might"] = "Veiled Might", ["Virulent Rupture"] = "Virulent Rupture", ["VirulentRupture"] = "VirulentRupture", ["Vital Palm"] = "Palma Vital", ["Vital Points"] = "Puntos Vitales", ["VitalPalm"] = "VitalPalm", ["Ejecucion del Vacio"] = "Ejecucion del Vacio", ["Void Guard"] = "Guardia del Vacio", ["Void Mender"] = "Sanador del Vacio", ["Volatile Ammunition"] = "Volatile Ammunition", ["Volatile Impact"] = "Volatile Impact", ["VolatileImpact"] = "VolatileImpact", ["Wand Specialist"] = "Wand Specialist", ["WandDamage"] = "WandDano", ["Warlock Talents"] = "Warlock Talents", ["Warrior"] = "Guerrero", ["Well of Power"] = "Well of Power", ["When Maledicion is applied to a target, it has a 20% (per level) chance to explode and send malefic pestilence to nearby enemies"] = "Cuando Maldicion se aplica a un objetivo, tiene un 20% de probabilidad (por nivel) de explotar y enviar pestilencia malefica a los enemigos cercanos", ["Wildhide Endurance"] = "Wildhide Endurance", ["WildhideEndurance"] = "WildhideEndurance", ["Winter Hunter"] = "Winter Hunter", ["Winter's Grasp"] = "Agarre del Invierno", ["You have a 2% (per level) chance to parry physical damage and send a small portion back to the attacker as energy damage."] = "Tienes un 2% de probabilidad (por nivel) de parar el dano fisico y devolver una pequena porcion al atacante como dano de energia.", ["Your Disparo Explosivo now instantly detonates your existing explosive barrels, and increase their damage by an aditional 10% and applying a burn to all nearby enemies"] = "Tu Disparo Explosivo ahora detona al instante tus barriles explosivos existentes, aumenta su dano un 10% adicional y aplica quemadura a todos los enemigos cercanos", ["Your Fire damage have a 1% chance per level to trigger 2 extra fireballs wich deal AOE fire damage"] = "Tu dano de fuego tiene un 1% de probabilidad por nivel de activar 2 bolas de fuego adicionales que causan dano de fuego en aarea", ["Your Short Circuit now have a chance 25% to grant you High Voltage, wich increases your magic level by 10% (per level) for 6 seconds."] = "Tu Short Circuit ahora tiene un 25% de probabilidad de otorgarte High Voltage, que aumenta tu nivel magico un 10% (por nivel) durante 6 segundos.", ["Your Taunt spell now deals Holy damage equal to 2% of your max health (per level) and applies a shield for 4 seconds equal to 30% of your max health."] = "Your Provocacion spell now deals Holy damage equal to 2% of your max health (per level) and applies a shield for 4 seconds equal to 30% of your max health.", ["Your Veil of Swords now heals you for 4% of your max health (per level) and grants you a dodge chance of 3% (per level) for 5 seconds."] = "Your Velo de Espadas now heals you for 4% of your max health (per level) and grants you a dodge chance of 3% (per level) for 5 seconds.", ["Your adaptive punch (ice + ice) now has a 5% (per level) chance to trigger Glacial Palm wich deals damage to the target and all nearby enemies."] = "Tu golpe adaptativo (hielo + hielo) ahora tiene un 5% de probabilidad (por nivel) de activar Glacial Palm, que causa dano al objetivo y a todos los enemigos cercanos.", ["Your auto attacks now have a 20% + 1% (per level) chance to grant you Momentum, which increases your attack speed for 1% (per level)  to a maximum of 95% for 4 seconds every time your attacks hit an enemy, this effect last until duration is over. Attacks will refresh the duration of momentum."] = "Tus ataques automaticos tienen un 20% + 1% (por nivel) de probabilidad de otorgarte Impulso, que aumenta tu velocidad de ataque un 1% (por nivel) hasta un maximo del 95% durante 4 segundos cada vez que golpeas a un enemigo. Los ataques renuevan la duracion del Impulso.", ["Your fire damage have a 2% chance (per level) to trigger Demolition, Demolition deals aoe physical damage on impact."] = "Tu dano de fuego tiene un 2% de probabilidad (por nivel) de activar Demolicion, que causa dano fisico en aarea al impactar.", ["Your judgement now grants you a 4% (per level) critical strike chance per 3 seconds"] = "Your judgement now grants you a 4% (per level) critical strike chance per 3 seconds", ["Your melee attacks have a 3% (per level) chance to deal extra death damage on hit."] = "Tus ataques cuerpo a cuerpo tienen un 3% de probabilidad (por nivel) de infligir dano de muerte adicional al golpear.", ["Your nature or earth damage, has a 2% (per level) chance to trigger a carnivorous vile with 45% effectiveness."] = "Your nature or earth damage, has a 2% (per level) chance to trigger a carnivorous vile with 45% effectiveness.", ["Your phantom shot now deals 4% (per level) additional damage if the target is below 50% health."] = "Tu Disparo Fantasma ahora causa un 4% (por nivel) de dano adicional si el objetivo tiene menos del 50% de vida.", ["Your physical damage has a 2% (per level) chance to trigger Dead from Above, Wich will trigger a bullet barrage from the sky that does fire damage to the target and nearby enemies."] = "Tu dano fisico tiene un 2% de probabilidad (por nivel) de activar Dead from Above, que desata una lluvia de balas del cielo causando dano de fuego al objetivo y los enemigos cercanos.", ["Your short circuit procs now restore 0.5% of your total mana per hit. (per level)"] = "Los procs de Short Circuit ahora restauran el 0.5% de tu mana total por golpe. (por nivel)", ["Your void mender now restores a part of your mana every time it heals a target \nIncrease the healing efficiency by 7% (per level)."] = "Tu Void Mender ahora restaura una parte de tu mana cada vez que cura a un objetivo.\\nAumenta la eficiencia de curacion un 7% (por nivel).", ["Zen Barrier"] = "Barrera Zen", ["Muro de Zombis"] = "Muro de Zombis", ["brutal swing has a 10% (per level) chance to heal you for 8% of your max health"] = "brutal swing has a 10% (per level) chance to heal you for 8% of your max health", ["drain soul now also affect an additional nearby cursed enemies around your targets. (+1 additional enemy per level)"] = "drain soul now also affect an additional nearby cursed enemies around your targets. (+1 additional enemy per level)", ["frost armor now deals damage to nearby enemies every 1.0 seconds, dealing 1% of your max mana as ice damage."] = "frost armor now deals damage to nearby enemies every 1.0 seconds, dealing 1% of your max mana as ice damage.", ["frost_wave"] = "frost_wave", ["increase your maximum mana by 10% (per level)"] = "Aumenta tu mana maximo un 10% (por nivel)", ["lethal dagger has a 12% (per level) chance to teleport you to your marked target and deal an aditional extra deathdamage"] = "lethal dagger has a 12% (per level) chance to teleport you to your marked target and deal an aditional extra deathdamage", ["Suelo Viviente"] = "Suelo Viviente", ["task points"] = "puntos de tarea", ["you are currently benefiting from +[[var1]]% BuffX"] = "you are currently benefiting from +[[var1]]% BuffX", ["you are currently benefiting from +[[var1]]% Critical Chance and +[[var2]]% Critical Amount"] = "Actualmente te beneficias de +[[var1]]% de probabilidad critica y +[[var2]]% de dano critico", ["you have a 3% (per level) chance to land a mystic punch every time you deal physical damage"] = "Tienes un 3% de probabilidad (por nivel) de asestar un golpe mistico cada vez que infliges dano fisico", ["your Judgement has a 5% chance to stun your target for 2 seconds"] = "your Juicio has a 5% chance to stun your target for 2 seconds", ["your Judgement now restores 3% (per level) of your total mana and applies a shield for the same amount for 3 seconds"] = "your Juicio now restores 3% (per level) of your total mana and applies a shield for the same amount for 3 seconds", ["A curious mind learns faster - gain +1% bonus experience from all monsters"] = "Una mente curiosa aprende mas rapido - gana +1% de experiencia extra de todos los monstruos", ["A curious mind learns faster - gain +10% bonus experience from all monsters"] = "Una mente curiosa aprende mas rapido - gana +10% de experiencia extra de todos los monstruos", ["A curious mind learns faster - gain +2% bonus experience from all monsters"] = "Una mente curiosa aprende mas rapido - gana +2% de experiencia extra de todos los monstruos", ["A curious mind learns faster - gain +3% bonus experience from all monsters"] = "Una mente curiosa aprende mas rapido - gana +3% de experiencia extra de todos los monstruos", ["A curious mind learns faster - gain +4% bonus experience from all monsters"] = "Una mente curiosa aprende mas rapido - gana +4% de experiencia extra de todos los monstruos", ["A curious mind learns faster - gain +5% bonus experience from all monsters"] = "Una mente curiosa aprende mas rapido - gana +5% de experiencia extra de todos los monstruos", ["A curious mind learns faster - gain +6% bonus experience from all m