 de probabilidad de generar un globo explosivo (50% de dano AoE, escala con nivel magico, 3s)", ["The show must go on - gain +10 magic level. Kills have a 45% chance to spawn an explosive balloon (150% AoE damage, scales with magic level, 3s)"] = "El espectaculo debe continuar - gana +10 nivel magico. Las kills tienen un 45% de probabilidad de generar un globo explosivo (150% de dano AoE, escala con nivel magico, 3s)", ["The show must go on - gain +2 magic level. Kills have a 18% chance to spawn an explosive balloon (60% AoE damage, scales with magic level, 3s)"] = "El espectaculo debe continuar - gana +2 nivel magico. Las kills tienen un 18% de probabilidad de generar un globo explosivo (60% de dano AoE, escala con nivel magico, 3s)", ["The show must go on - gain +3 magic level. Kills have a 21% chance to spawn an explosive balloon (70% AoE damage, scales with magic level, 3s)"] = "El espectaculo debe continuar - gana +3 nivel magico. Las kills tienen un 21% de probabilidad de generar un globo explosivo (70% de dano AoE, escala con nivel magico, 3s)", ["The show must go on - gain +4 magic level. Kills have a 24% chance to spawn an explosive balloon (80% AoE damage, scales with magic level, 3s)"] = "El espectaculo debe continuar - gana +4 nivel magico. Las kills tienen un 24% de probabilidad de generar un globo explosivo (80% de dano AoE, escala con nivel magico, 3s)", ["The show must go on - gain +5 magic level. Kills have a 27% chance to spawn an explosive balloon (90% AoE damage, scales with magic level, 3s)"] = "El espectaculo debe continuar - gana +5 nivel magico. Las kills tienen un 27% de probabilidad de generar un globo explosivo (90% de dano AoE, escala con nivel magico, 3s)", ["The show must go on - gain +6 magic level. Kills have a 30% chance to spawn an explosive balloon (100% AoE damage, scales with magic level, 3s)"] = "El espectaculo debe continuar - gana +6 nivel magico. Las kills tienen un 30% de probabilidad de generar un globo explosivo (100% de dano AoE, escala con nivel magico, 3s)", ["The show must go on - gain +7 magic level. Kills have a 33% chance to spawn an explosive balloon (110% AoE damage, scales with magic level, 3s)"] = "El espectaculo debe continuar - gana +7 nivel magico. Las kills tienen un 33% de probabilidad de generar un globo explosivo (110% de dano AoE, escala con nivel magico, 3s)", ["The show must go on - gain +8 magic level. Kills have a 36% chance to spawn an explosive balloon (120% AoE damage, scales with magic level, 3s)"] = "El espectaculo debe continuar - gana +8 nivel magico. Las kills tienen un 36% de probabilidad de generar un globo explosivo (120% de dano AoE, escala con nivel magico, 3s)", ["The show must go on - gain +9 magic level. Kills have a 40% chance to spawn an explosive balloon (130% AoE damage, scales with magic level, 3s)"] = "El espectaculo debe continuar - gana +9 nivel magico. Las kills tienen un 40% de probabilidad de generar un globo explosivo (130% de dano AoE, escala con nivel magico, 3s)", ["Thrive in solitude - when adventuring alone, kills restore 3% HP and Mana and grant +2% bonus experience"] = "Prospera en soledad - al aventurar solo, las kills restauran 3% de PV y Mana y otorgan +2% de experiencia extra", ["Thrive in solitude - when adventuring alone, kills restore 3.5% HP and Mana and grant +2.5% bonus experience"] = "Prospera en soledad - al aventurar solo, las kills restauran 3.5% de PV y Mana y otorgan +2.5% de experiencia extra", ["Thrive in solitude - when adventuring alone, kills restore 4% HP and Mana and grant +3% bonus experience"] = "Prospera en soledad - al aventurar solo, las kills restauran 4% de PV y Mana y otorgan +3% de experiencia extra", ["Thrive in solitude - when adventuring alone, kills restore 4.5% HP and Mana and grant +3.5% bonus experience"] = "Prospera en soledad - al aventurar solo, las kills restauran 4.5% de PV y Mana y otorgan +3.5% de experiencia extra", ["Thrive in solitude - when adventuring alone, kills restore 5% H